                "obs-58b8edcdb583d0c1df1a56d7"
              ],
              "statement": "合并收入与营业利润不受分部重述影响，各期间保持原报告口径。",
              "citations": [
                {
                  "source_snapshot_id": "source-0019ae7ba0f6e3b63f944782",
                  "block_id": "block-000818-3a2e0b27",
                  "quote": "The recast of prior period information had no impact on our consolidated balance sheets, consolidated income statements, or consolidated cash flows statements."
